    "text": "laconiadailysun.com\nwebsite\nLaconia\nMaine resident charged with trying to use counterfeit money to buy gift cards\nBy GABRIEL PERRY, The Laconia Daily Sun,\n10 hours agoLACONIA — Police charged one person from Maine after attempting to purchase gift cards at Walmart with counterfeit money for a second time last week. Shawn White, 40, of Westbrook, Maine, is charged with two counts of felony forgery, and three counts of being in possession of false identification.",
